     "title": "Jony Ive&#8217;s first OpenAI gadget is reportedly a hockey puck-sized smart speaker",
     "url": "https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/976431/openai-chatgpt-battery-smart-speaker-rumor",
