     "title": "German construction giant launches 3D printing division after printing new headquarters",
     "url": "https://roboticsandautomationnews.com/2026/08/06/german-construction-giant-launches-3d-printing-division-after-printing-new-headquarters/103965/",
     "time": "08-06 22:20",
