     "source": "SpaceNews",
     "content": "In this episode, SpaceNews’ Emma Gatti leads a panel of experts to discuss Europe’s defense posture and the reaction to space threats. This session was recorded in May at SpaceNews’ defense stage in Amsterdam at Small Sat Europe.\nJoining the panel are:\n- Brigadier General Daniele Donati, Former Chief of the Space Policy Office, Italian Defense General Staff\n- Dr. Regina Peldszus, Space Security Specialist, European External Action Service\n- Antonin Hirsch, Co-founder and CTO, Skynopy\n- Andrew Faiola, Commercial Director, Astroscale\n- David Tellett, Programme Director, Magdrive Ltd\nSponsored by\nArrow Electronics is a Fortune 500-ranked distributor of electronic components and enterprise computing products that helps thousands of leading manufacturers and service providers turn technology ideas into market-ready solutions. From concept and design through sourcing, integration, manufacturing, and lifecycle management, Arrow comes alongside innovators with deep engineering expertise, comprehensive supply chain services and one of the industry’s most extensive product portfolios. Whether helping enable next-generation aerospace and defense systems, AI-driven applications, industrial automation, robotics platforms or connected devices, Arrow helps its customers accelerate innovation, solve complex design challenges, and bring mission-critical technologies to market faster.\nAbout Space Minds\nSpace Minds is a new audio and video podcast from SpaceNews that focuses on the inspiring leaders, technologies and exciting opportunities in space.\nThe weekly podcast features compelling interviews with scientists, founders and experts who love to talk about space, covers the news that has enthusiasts daydreaming, and engages with listeners. Join David Ariosto, Mike Gruss and journalists from the SpaceNews team for new episodes every Thursday.\nWatch a new episode every Thursday on SpaceNews.com and on our YouTube, Spotify and Apple channels.\nBe the first to know when new episodes drop! Enter your email, and we’ll make sure you get exclusive access to each episode as soon as it goes live!\nSpace Minds Podcast\n\"*\" indicates required fields\nNote: By registering, you consent to receive communications from SpaceNews and our partners.",
