     "url": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/her-bank-accounts-were-stripped-bare-by-medicaid-my-late-friend-had-20-000-in-credit-card-debt-will-her-life-insurance-pay-for-it-17ee9792?mod=mw_rss_topstories",
